Potential issue: when we skip an edge because parent visited, we don't push; fine.

Now memory bound: O(path length + nodes) not O(n²). For wide graph, stack frames O(depth), visited O(depth), pathEdges O(depth), but adjacency holds O(E) edges once. Good.

