- The duplicate links cause `.some` O(d²) but functional same.
- "dedupe still yields one path" perhaps better to isolate duplicate: a child with duplicate links to same parent plus other parents. Assert exact count.

Maybe also a simpler direct test: `iv-d` has `[link('iv-a-1','CONTINUATION'), link('iv-a-1','CONTINUATION')]`, discoverPaths returns 1 path. But high-degree test covers. Could add both in one test.

